<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Shipping Policy - Shunyata</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-10 px-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Shipping Policy</h1>
    <p class="mb-4">Shunyata Eco Resort primarily provides hospitality services. However, if you order products (such as souvenirs or eco-friendly goods), the following shipping policy applies.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">1. Delivery Timelines</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">Orders are processed within 2–3 business days. Delivery timelines depend on your location, typically between 5–10 business days.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">2. Shipping Charges</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">Shipping charges are calculated at checkout and may vary based on weight and destination.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">3. International Shipping</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">Currently, we only ship within India. International shipping will be announced soon.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">4. Contact Us</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">For any shipping-related queries, contact us at <span class="text-blue-600">support@shunyata.com</span>.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>